{"1704550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TEST RE", "steam_appid": 1704550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3588720], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.poster.avif?t=1762633463\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.webm?t=1762633463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.mp4?t=1762633463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a spooky lodge or laboratory. <br>And use pistols, rifles, rocket launchers and other weapons to fight monsters and escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Full support of 4K HDR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEST RE features full support of 4K HDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatibility with 16bit HDR implements a gorgeous presentation that goes beyond usual HDR. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■An evolved sound system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Sound Effect(RSE) was experimentally introduced to previous works, and received extraordinarily high ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's evolved to Enhance Real Sound Effect(ERSE).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror productions that featured 3D Space Audio were able to be transformed into completely new horror experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translator:Richard Lenerz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks:Tobias Nitsch &amp; Steve Russell</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.poster.avif?t=1762633463\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.webm?t=1762633463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1704550/extras/6443c482c9028db9c1019b2690813cca.mp4?t=1762633463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a spooky lodge or laboratory. <br>And use pistols, rifles, rocket launchers and other weapons to fight monsters and escape.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Full support of 4K HDR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TEST RE features full support of 4K HDR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatibility with 16bit HDR implements a gorgeous presentation that goes beyond usual HDR. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■An evolved sound system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real Sound Effect(RSE) was experimentally introduced to previous works, and received extraordinarily high ratings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's evolved to Enhance Real Sound Effect(ERSE).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror productions that featured 3D Space Audio were able to be transformed into completely new horror experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translator:Richard Lenerz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Thanks:Tobias Nitsch &amp; Steve Russell</p>", "short_description": "A short 5 minute horror game!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steam